      "username": "Shadowstripe",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/shadowstripe/{size}/1890_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-01-08T00:26:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am curious as to when the Red Abilities in the Psychic Power category in Chapter 3 were changed.&nbsp; Last time I looked at them (around the 2nd download), there were specific abilities for specific Psychic Powers (for the most part), but in this latest version, the abilities no longer specify specific powers.&nbsp; This is a welcome change as it gives psychic characters the same freedom of choice other categories tend to have in regards to what abilities they can have.&nbsp; Just curious if this is new for this iteration of Chapter 3 or was present in the last one too (don't make many Psychic Characters and had a hard drive crash about a month ago, so I only noticed with this new download).</p>\n<p>Still hoping that we will get Hero and Villain auxilery sheet PDF downloads eventually too (probably closer to when the final PDF is finished as it this is likely a low priority at the moment).</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:04:20.545Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
